  "guidePcBody": "Setup — install the Loop plugin in Claude Code on your computer. Type these two lines in Claude Code: /plugin marketplace add devnoyo0123/loop-skill → /plugin install loop@loop. Then just tell Claude \"connect my phone\" — it gives you the address and an 8-digit code. ① In Settings → PC connection, enter that address and connect ② enter the code and you're connected — it reconnects automatically from then on. Logs stay on your phone; only queries and results travel over your Wi-Fi."
